[I] A unix pager optimized for psql

[T] pspg (Postgres Pager) is a specialized Unix pager for tabular data,
[T] designed for psql but also usable with mysql, sqlite, pgcli, monetdb,
[T] usql and others. It supports frozen header rows and columns, horizontal
[T] and vertical scrolling, searching, themes, mouse and clipboard export.

[U] https://github.com/okbob/pspg

[A] Pspg Authors
